window.products.push({"id":580014,"name":"Crystallove Black Nylon Skimmer, Drainer, Kitchen Gadgets and Utensils","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OXR7ihaIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Specifically designed, Full Screen Coverage, Case Friendly (might not be compatible with rugged cases that are designed to cover on top of the screen) Bubble Free Guaranteed, Designed for easy installation Ultra thin-0.3mm thickness is reliable and resilient, and promises full compatibility with touchscreen sensitivity Highly durable, and scratch resistant - surface hardness 9H Includes: 1x Glass Screen Protector, 1 Easy Installation Tray Wet/Dry Wipes, MicroFiber Cleaning Cloth, Dust Removal Stickers and Installation and Use Guidance","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OXR7ihaIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sliiq","source_asin":"B014XZTE90","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014XZTE90","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014XZTE90","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":580015,"name":"Herman Miller Setu Ergonomic Office Chair with Kinematic Spine | H-Alloy Base and Hard Floor Casters | Chino Frame and Rattan Lyris Fabric","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xyqOlGJoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There's a height adjustment. That's it. How refreshing! Setu is such a sophisticated task chair that its movement and conformation to your body are controlled simply by your weight when you sit down. This innovation is made possible by the simple complexity of the chair's Kinematic Spine, designed to combine strength and a flexibility that bends and moves automatically with your every move. And by the elastomeric fabric that provides superior suspension and conforms to your contours. Simplicity created by geometry: Mathematics replaces mechanisms. Features: The Not-so-secret Secret: Polypropylene: After testing dozens of materials, we found that the smartest solution was also the simplest—the same material used to make toothbrushes and garbage cans. It's the unique combination of two different polypropylenes—one for the spine, another for the spokes—that helps create the perfect combination of strength and flex in a lightweight and durable form. Cool and Supple: Lyris 2 suspension material is an advance in support. Air flow keeps you cool. The material’s double interlocking weave construction adds strength and durability for a firm sit and a distinctive sheen. Working in concert with the spine, Lyris 2 distributes your weight evenly and conforms to your contours. It’s another example of elegance in the name of performance. Less Is…Less Impact on the Earth: Setu chairs are manufactured using 100 percent green electrical energy—half from wind and half from captured landfill off-gassing. And the production produces no air or water emissions. The chair weighs only 18 pounds. The durable uncoated H-Alloy aluminum base is naturally anti-corrosive and requires no harmful toxins. Made with 42 percent recycled materials, Setu chairs are 93 percent recyclable. Task-ready: The Setu chair has a five-star base for stability while working and casters to keep you mobile.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xyqOlGJoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Herman Miller","source_asin":"B004VO9LWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004VO9LWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004VO9LWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":580016,"name":"LIFERECORD 10 Inch Full Size Mattress, Medium Feel Memory Foam Mattress, Gel Bamboo Charcoal Memory Foam Mattresses Regulates Temperature, Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J2pNvhD4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tripple-Layer Foam Mattress -- The 10\" memory foam mattress is designed for all sleepers. The medium-feel mattress is designed with a three-layer full foam system for improved support and heat dissipation, the mattress layers include a 2.5'' gel bamboo charcoal AeroFusion memory foam, 2.5\" liquid gel flex-foam and 5\" flex support base foam\" for ultimate comfort. Isolation Support -- This full size mattress uses high-density memory foam to enhance head-to-toe support throughout the mattress, adapting and conforming to your body for optimal pressure release; while providing motion isolation, even when your partner moves away, you can also sleep deeply throughout the night without interruptions. Create A Comfortable Night's Sleep -- The memory foam mattress is made of gel bamboo charcoal AeroFusion memory foam and a breathable jacquard fabric cover, which adapts to the environment, keeping you cool in summer and warm in winter. The soft quilted hood provides extra comfort and breathability to help dissipate body heat and increase your sleep depth, and the special surface based on memory foam provides an ultra-soft cloud-like feel every night. Fiberglass Free FR Inner Cover -- The mattress' inner cover provides a safe, effective flame retardant layer around our mattress. This means no skin irritation, breathing problems to you and your family. Each 8\" memory foam mattress is individually tested to meet the industry's highest requirements and to comply with all regulations set forth by CertiPUR-US. Mattress in a Box -- Made in USA. Every LIFRECORD mattress is covered by our 10-year limited warranty. This mattress is professionally compressed, rolled up and shipped in a compact box for great convenience. For a better sleep experience, you just need to unpack, cut the plastic wrap, and wait 72 hours for the mattress to fully unfold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J2pNvhD4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFERECORD","source_asin":"B09VNZ9Y7F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VNZ9Y7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VNZ9Y7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
