window.products.push({"id":580237,"name":"UMLo Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 300W 28Kpa Cordless Stick Vacuum with LED Display, Up to 60mins Runtime, 4000mAh Battery Cordless Vacuum, 6 in 1 Lightwe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6132SUNj7mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤POWERFUL SUCTION & BRUSHLESS DIGITAL MOTOR: This cordless vacuum cleaner is equipped with a 300W upgraded brushless digital motor, generates 150 AW suction power and 28K PA suction force on max mode, easily picks up pet hair and debris from carpet, hardwood floor, tile, car, stairs, sofa, etc. Umlo brushless stick vacuum is more energy-saving and has a longer service life, compared with other regular brushed vacuum cleaners. ❤60 MINS LONG-LASTING RUNTIME: This cordless stick vacuum adopts a 10 x 4000m-A-h large capacity battery (extra 4 cells than others vacuum), provides up to 60 mins runtime for deep cleaning in standard mode, three suction modes for choosing, ideal for large jobs and full house cleaning. Meanwhile, this battery rechargeable vacuum cordless provides over-voltage, overheat, and short-circuit protection. The battery is rechargeable and detachable but could be charged only when connected to the main motor. ❤TOUCH SCREEN & LED DISPLAY: The large touch LED screen on the cordless stick vacuum displays indicators, including roller brush clog alert, filter clog alert, power mode indicator, and power mode switch, you can touch the switch to change power modes. This makes it effortless to adjust the vacuum power and know the status of your stick vacuum cleaner. This design is more convenient and trouble-free compared with traditional button operation. ❤INCREASE 30% SUCTION POWER: This stick vacuum cleaner cordless adopts new-est In-line Configuration design. The motor, dustbin, and cyclone of the vacuum cordless are aligned, so air is drawn into the cyclones in a straight line – creating 30% more suction power than other cordless vacuum cleaner pet hair. Enjoy the brand experience like dyxon at affordable pricees. ❤FLEXIBLE LED MOTORIZED BRUSH & ONE BUTTON EMPTY： Flexible 135° swivel sideways and 90° up and down lets you clean your home in all directions. The maneuverable motorized floor brush head features 5 LED lights, making rechargeable vacuum cordless easy to clean the dust under furniture or in the hard-to-reach corner. One button to quickly empty the 0.8L large dustbin, no need to touch the dirt. Umlo cordless vacuum cleaner provides you excellent cleaning experience. ❤MEET ALL YOUR CLEANING NEEDS: This battery powered vacuum comes with a motorized brush, a 2 in 1 brush, and a long crevice, they can be easily assembled into 6 combinations for versatile cleanings, like a handheld vacuum which is very suitable for sofas, car, keyboards, and gaps. Retractable metal tube for convenient adjusting heights. The specially designed Easy Rest allows you to safely prop the vacuum up on countertops and furniture. No worry about after-sales, we offer 12-Month customer service. Any questions, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6132SUNj7mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UMLo","source_asin":"B0C4VF839T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4VF839T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4VF839T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
