window.products.push({"id":580287,"name":"Totally Bamboo Carving Board 22 X 15","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I3R3YhwbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These beautiful, new Totally Bamboo Carving Boards are made of hard wearing, sustainable bamboo which looks good, is easy to maintain and helps to keep your knives in good condition. This large carving board has a juice groove around the edge to stop liquids from spilling off your board, and convenient handholds for ease of lifting and carrying. Bamboo is 16% harder than maple wood, 1/3 lighter in weight than oak, yet in some instances as strong as steel. Bamboo holds the promise of a sustainable, cost effective, and ecologically responsible alternative to the widespread clearcutting of our old growth forests. Totally Bamboo is at the forefront of new, unique and innovative product design. Features of their boards include: They use highly skilled craftsmen The boards are thoroughly fine sanded resulting in a silky smooth touch. High grade, non-toxic food grade glue is used exclusively. No artificial dyes or stains are used. There are 2 colors, light and dark. The light is the natural color of bamboo. The dark is \"cooked\" to perfection, literally, a result of the heating process. The natural sugar in the wood is caramelized, producing the beautiful honey color. This is permanent and will not wash off. This allows the boards to be sanded if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I3R3YhwbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B003WH309G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003WH309G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003WH309G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
