window.products.push({"id":580344,"name":"NOTCHIS Ivory and Dreamy Purple Floating Beads No Hole Pearl for Vases, Highlight Pearl Bead Vase Fillers for Centerpieces, 30mm, 20mm, and 14mm, DIY ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hJFSW8BtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dear Valued Customer, Create attractive Floating Beads Pearls centerpieces for your special day! Surprise your family, friends, and guests! These pearls use unique polishing and brightening technology. Great for your elegant events such as weddings, bridal showers, anniversaries, graduations, Valentine's Day, and business socials! Important Questions and Answers Q:Why do the pearls sink or not float? A: You didn't use the Water Gels. Or you put too less Gel Beads in your vase and the pearls will sink. 18-20mm gel beads can effectively hold jumbo pearls. You can purchase our Notchis Water Gels. They will grow to 18-20mm size in the water. Q: Why my Water Gels are not Transparent? A: You didn't fully hydrate the Water Gels. Or you didn't pour water in your vase. The Water and Water Gels in vase will make your pearls look like floating. Q: How to hydrate the Water Gels? A: The beads require soaking in water for 6 hours. 1 L/1 quart/32oz of water: 1.5 tsp beads 64oz of water: 3 tsp beads 1 gallon of water: 5 tsp beads Q: How many pearls would I need to decorate 2 vases? A: It really depends on the size of your vase. An average vase size 4\" x 10\" a good amount is 15-25 pieces. 50 pearls can decorate about 2-3 4\" x 10\" large vases with water gel beads. Q: How to purchase water gels? A: Please search on Amazon: Notchis Water Gels. Material: Faux Pearl Specifications: Ivory Pearl Bead Size: 4 jumbo (30mm/1.25”d), 14 large (20mm/0.75”d) and 32 medium (14mm/55”d) pearls Dreamy Purple Pearl Bead Size: 4 jumbo (30mm/1.25”d), 14 large (20mm/0.75”d) and 32 medium (14mm/55”d) pearls Package Includes: 50 pcs Ivory Pearls 50 pcs Dreamy Purple Pearls 1 pcs Lable: Easy to follow instructions with illustrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hJFSW8BtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOTCHIS","source_asin":"B0B2NVMBBB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2NVMBBB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2NVMBBB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":580345,"name":"Swan STM201N Vintage Teasmade - Rapid Water Boiler with Clock and Alarm Featuring a Clock Light with Dimmer and a 600ml Water Tank, 780-850W, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JtPj32LSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Steeped in history, the Teasmade concept can be traced back to 1891 when its inventor, Samuel Rowbottom, developed the first ‘Teawaker’, which became known as the Teasmade from 1932. Hugely popular in the 60s, 70s and 80s, Teasmades quickly became a design icon. By the early noughties, stock was extremely sought after and flew off the shelves as soon as they became available. Swan re-introduced them to the market in 2009 and is proud to offer a range of contemporary and classic models with rapid boil functions, analogue as well as LCD clocks and ceramic teapots - perfect for when one cup is just not enough!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JtPj32LSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swan","source_asin":"B0794JD62P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0794JD62P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0794JD62P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
