window.products.push({"id":580383,"name":"Deland Complete Bed with Curved Grill Design and Finial Posts, Brown Sparkle Finish, Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716YVNar9QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Deland has a truly eclectic style, marrying straight and rounded lines and profiles. Constructed of carbon steel, the round, sturdy posts of the 53-inch headboard and 33-inch footboard are topped with detailed finials that are joined together by gracefully arched rails. This aesthetically pleasing bed has a Brown Sparkle finish which adds just enough shimmer to allow sunlight to bounce off, calling immediate attention to the artistically sculpted spindles. Light dusting with a soft cloth will keep the finish looking new for years to come. The engineered bed frame consists of iron rails, cross arms and glides to provide full support to your mattress and box spring. A good ornamental bed, like the Deland, will fuse with the surrounding décor, accent other bedroom furniture and transform an ordinary room into something interesting and sophisticated. This unit includes a headboard and footboard panel, bed frame, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. The Leggett & Platt Deland Complete Bed comes with a 10-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716YVNar9QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B076B6TTFW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076B6TTFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076B6TTFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
