window.products.push({"id":580387,"name":"Steak Ninja Meat Tenderizer 56 Stainless Steel Blades for Faster Marinating & Cooking Times","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nhX-URWsL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Secret to Tender More Flavorful Steaks, Seafood, Chicken, Game. The Best Meat Tenderizer on the Market Makes Your Meals Delicious! Impress Your Friends and Family and Make Cooking Easy! 56 razor sharp stainless steel blades built to last, Can be used on steak, poultry, seafood, pork, game, Penetrates allowing marinades, spices and flavors to infuse quickly, evenly, deeply, Dishwasher Safe, easy to store, portable, Reduces cooking time, Promotes more even cooking, Built in safety lock & protective cap. Steak Ninja is backed by a Lifetime No-Hassle Free Replacement Guarantee. Click the button at the top of this page to make meats more tender and flavorful. The Steak Ninja Tenderizer It's the ultimate tool for tenderizing and adding flavor to your favorite cuts of meat. It's also your secret weapon when it comes to making tougher cuts of meats melt in your mouth. If you're a hunter and you want to increase the tenderness of your game, the Steak Ninja is for you! Traditional tenderizers hammer and pulverize meat. But the Steak Ninja's 56 stainless steel blades penetrate meats with clean cuts. It reduces cooking time by up to 40% and promotes more even cooking. And it's more than a tenderizer! The Steak Ninja allows your marinades, spices and flavors to penetrate more deeply and consistently. This not only adds flavor, it also reduces marinating time. It comes with built-in safety lock to protect your blades and a cap making it portable, safe and easy to store. It's dishwasher safe. Steak Ninja has been tested by top chefs and is the premium weapon of choice for those who want to serve delicious appetizing meals to friends and family and make it look easy! Makes a great gift for anyone who loves cooking gadgets!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nhX-URWsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Steak Ninja","source_asin":"B00L9VHEOO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L9VHEOO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L9VHEOO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
