window.products.push({"id":580528,"name":"Hummingbird Glass Straws Clear Straight 9\" x 9.5 mm Made With Pride In The USA - Perfect Reusable Straw For Smoothies, Tea, Juice, Water, Essential Oi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dZZ13N0sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Hummingbird Glass Straws Are The Best Durable Non-toxic Environmentally Friendly Can be Used in Hot or Cold Drinks Safe for Kids Shatter Proof Protect Teeth from Cavities and Stains Affordable Dishwasher Safe Easy and Safe to Carry with You Everywhere! Fully Guaranteed Handmade in the USA What To Expect From Your Hummingbird Glass Straw Order You will receive one beautifully designed package containing 4 quality straight Hummingbird Glass Straws. Plus you'll get a cleaning brush! (No, they're not hard to clean, you can pop them in the dishwasher; the brush is just in case you get something stuck). These straws are 9 inches long x 9.5 mm in diameter, which is perfect for smoothies, juice, coffee, and teas. They're angled perfectly to make sipping easy. The glass is perfectly clear, and both ends are smooth and rounded so they're comfortable to use. Everyone is Joining the Glass Straw Movement! Glass straws have long been popular with environmentalists, but now celebrities like Oprah and Ralph Lauren spokesmodel (and health nut) Valentina Zelyaeva are joining the cause! With the focus on health-destroying plastic toxins and rampant environmental pollution, glass straws aren't just a trend — they're a health and wellness movement that's here to stay. Made in the U.S.A. Each Hummingbird Glass Straw is handmade in our studio. These are not cheap, assembly-line glass straws other companies sell, they're the real deal. Every straw is inspected by hand for quality. Don't contribute to pollution and risk your health by using plastic straws-get a Hummingbird Glass Straw today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dZZ13N0sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hummingbird Glass Straws","source_asin":"B00KCZAMAQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KCZAMAQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KCZAMAQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
