window.products.push({"id":580659,"name":"WORHE Clear Acrylic Napkin Holder Tray Guest Tower Hand Tower Holder for Bathroom Kitchen Clear Paper Tower Holder Storage with Wooden Center Bar for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iFR32ip2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[TAKE NAPKINS WITHOUT STRUGGLE] A 0.8”D x 7.9”L central weighty wood bar is designed to anchor for this napkin holder, prevent tissue bellowing even for outdoor use and windy days. Besides, the central bar could always keep the tissue paper in place when you take one without mess up. In addition, 2 opening sides for you and others take out napkins easily from different directions. [HIGH CAPACITY] 7.9”W x 7”L x 2.1”H size acrylic napkin holders could contain enough standard 7”x7” size napkin or wrap tissue paper. So, you do not need to fill it often during the parties but enjoying your social time. [NON-SLIP MAT] 4 little rubber pads are under napkin holder, they prevent it slipping around or off the table. Since tray bottom will not contact the surface of counter top or drawer, this design could also protect them from scratching. [QUALITY ACRYLIC] Our acrylic tissue dispenser is made from thick acrylic, which is sturdy. It also has strong adaptability to the natural environment, even if it is exposed to sunlight, wind and rain for a long time, it will not change its performance, so can be used safely outdoors. Please note that do not use alcohol or rough cloth to wipe, instead to wipe by damp soft cloth. [PERFECT FOR ANY OCCASION] Minimalist and clear look makes this napkin dispenser perfectly match any house design, shows your original table pattern while organize your napkin well, also fit in your home decor wonderfully. Good for indoor and outdoor used, hotel, restaurant, parties and weddings, everyday use on kitchen island, countertops, dining table, picnic table etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iFR32ip2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WORHE","source_asin":"B0B316JPC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B316JPC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B316JPC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":580660,"name":"ZckyCine Modern Mid-Century Dining Table Set for 6-8 People Kitchen Dining Room Table Set Extendable Solid Wood Dining Table and 6 Upholstered Chairs,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":899.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NUysr9VQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"7-Piece Dining Set: With its rectangular table top and characterful legs, this 7-piece dining set represents an elegant and airy atmosphere. The elegant natural wood grain on the table top and the upholstered dining chairs are suitable for a farmhouse or a contemporary style dining room. In addition, the adjustable table length makes this dining set suitable for any size room. Adjustable dining table length: The dining table features a U-shaped sturdy metal leg base, and with different use scenarios in mind, the table in this set has a flexible design with adjustable length. The rectangular table's plank tabletop slowly unfolds along the edge can be extended to accommodate more guests, seating 6-8 people, with the freedom and flexibility to arrange your space in any way you like, this dining table set is all set to meet your requirements for a large family. Premium Leather Upholstered Dining Chairs: Our dining chairs are cushioned with premium faux leather and high resilient foam. The dining chairs have metal tubular legs that sturdily support the seat with a high weight capacity. Maximum weight-bearing capacity: 300 lbs. The seat and backrest of the stool are ergonomically curved, softer and thicker. Dining table and chair set dimensions: table spread: 78.7 x 35.4 x 29.9 inches, table shrink: 62.9 x 35.4 x 29.9 inches (L x W x H); dining chairs. 18.8 x 17.7 x 35.4 inches (L x W x H); seat to floor: 18.1 inches. Installation instructions and weight capacity: This kitchen dining room table and chairs set is delivered in separate packages ,the weight capacity of the table top is 260 pounds and the weight capacity of each chair is 330 pounds. You can always contact me if you have any questions, if there is a problem with the table in transit, please contact me for your replacement, we have professional customer service for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NUysr9VQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZckyCine","source_asin":"B0BMXCM96Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMXCM96Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMXCM96Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
