window.products.push({"id":580664,"name":"instecho jar Opener, dr1, aerga1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RSpyhX9DL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Operating the Can Opener Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can Trouble Shooting 1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. 3. If the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of the can opener. Note: 1) Use 2 new batteries ( High quality AA batteries), cheaper less quality new batteries are inadequate and may not preform as necessary. 2) After completely revolving around the can and cutting the edge, the can will still appear to be sealed. After prying up the lid will it be evident that the can and its resealable lid are detached. 3) Do not lift or forcefully remove the can opener from the can while it is operational. Forceful removal can cause damage to the knife-edge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RSpyhX9DL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"instecho","source_asin":"B075RZ5MSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075RZ5MSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075RZ5MSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":580665,"name":"Lotarrotta Queen Comforter Set Floral Grey Bedding Comforter Sets Lightweight All Seasons for Queen Size Bed Luxury Boho Style Down Alternative Fluffy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OQhGnLfdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATERIALS--This queen comforter set is made of premium quality 100% brushed microfiber with soft microfiber inner fill, which is cool and breathable. Microfiber fabric naturally wrinkled, shrinkage-resistant, and more durable than cotton. This ultra-soft comforter set keeps you comfortable all through the night. FLORAL PATTERN & DESIGN--Queen size comforter sets for a queen bed are designed with boho style botanical floral and leaves pattern print on the terracotta duvet cover, vibrant garden floral duvet cover will brighten your rooms, add stylish and vintage elements to your room. The floral comforter set brings a breath of spring to any season. WHAT YOU WILL GET--Bedding sets queen with comforter and pillowcases include 3Pcs in total, 1 x comforter (90\"x 90\") filled with 300GSM down alternative and 2 x embroidered flange pillow shams(20\"x26\").Perfect gift for men and women at special festivals, such as housewarmings, Christmas, Thanksgiving, and birthdays. ALL-SEASON USING--Lightweight and fluffy bedding comforters made of 100% soft polyester are available for year-round use. The bedding comforter set keeps you warm in the winter and fit to use as a quilt in summer. To reduce your time on making the bed, our comforter can be used direct. Also, it can be used as an alternative comforter with your favorite duvet cover. EASY CARE--Machine wash separately on cold water with similar colors, gentle cycle, tumble dry at low heat. Do not use bleach to keep the color vibrant. Our comforter stays soft and durable after every wash.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OQhGnLfdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lotarrotta","source_asin":"B09XBC464M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XBC464M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XBC464M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
