window.products.push({"id":580694,"name":"UPIT Master Preseasoned Cast Iron Skillet, Nonstick Rustproof Lightweight Wok with Wooden Handle, 9.5 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41w-wvSFFwL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"🍳 MASTER PRE-SEASONED SKILLET – Skip annoying seasoning of cast iron pan! It takes lots of time to do some boring processes of spreading the oil and heat the pan up several times. And if you fail or do the thing in wrong way, sometimes you ruin the whole pan at all. But, UPIT Master Cast Iron Skillet is already seasoned with nonstick coating! You simply put some oil and enjoy your cook. How comfortable it is! 👍 RUSTLESS CAST IRON UNDER TECH – UPIT Cast Iron Skillet has been advanced than others. “Nitriding Heat Treatment”, which is a process working at a 950℉ and a high pressure for 12 hours, applied on our cast iron. Thanks to the delicate process, it stands in any of harsh environment and would not rust easily with extreme resistance to abrasion. 👑 HIGH QUALITY NONSTICK FUNCTION – Elaborately carved embossed surface making a gap between food and the pan, allows the air & oil to go through. Also, high quality nonstick “Megastone Coating” mixed with Zirconium & Ceramic materials such as biotite for more durability protecting against scratches. It passed the abrasion test of 50,000 cycles whereas normal PTFE coating peels off 10,000 cycles. Absolutely safe and none of any harmful chemical ingredients such as lead, cadmium, PFOA, PFOS, etc. ⚖️ LIGHT WEIGHT DESIGN – Reducing unnecessary thickness of pan guarantees both lightweight and high heat conductivity. A bit thinner than other cast iron skillet, but better for cooking. Perfectly suitable for stir-frying or grilling with much lighter weight than others! Also using sturdy beechwood handle, it looks luxurious in your tidy kitchen. It doesn't get hot to keep safe during cooking, while others with whole cast iron body are getting hot and mandatory to use silicon cover for handle. 🔥 AVAILABLE FOR ALL HEAT SOURCES – Compatible with all stovetops, induction, grill, hotplate, and electro. You can cook wherever you want, indoor kitchen and outdoor camping. Also it is dishwasher safe, so you don’t have to hold heavy cast iron pan to wash by your hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41w-wvSFFwL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UPIT","source_asin":"B091KL8DFW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091KL8DFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091KL8DFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
