window.products.push({"id":580759,"name":"Roaring 20's - 1920s Art Deco Jazz Party Decorations for Women and Men - Wine Bottle Label Stickers - Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713pz+lVscL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Roaring 20's Wine Bottle Gift Set INCLUDES Set of 4 art deco jazz wine bottle sticker labels in the 1920s party theme. Wine and liquor bottle stickers each SIZE 4 inches wide x 5 inches tall, perfect for standard 750ml bottles. EASY TO USE: Prepare your beverage bottles by ensuring they are room temperature. Removing the original bottle label is not necessary. Carefully peel one adhesive Roaring 20's Wine Bottle Label from the backing and adhere to a bottle, starting at the edge and rolling to the opposite edge. Press down to smooth. HIGH QUALITY 1920S SUPPLIES: Roaring 20's wine bottle labels are professionally printed on an adhesive paper with a glossy coating. They are waterproof and can be used on bottles that will be chilled, just be sure to apply prior to chilling. Add them to a jazz party beverage bar for an impressive, coordinated display. UNIQUE 1920S GIFT IDEA: Jazz Wine Bottle Labels also make a great gift idea. Add Roaring 20's Wine Bottle labels to a favorite bottle of wine or spirits for a special twenties gift. Use each wine label on a favorite beverage bottle and gift individually or create an impressive 1920s gift basket using all 4 labels on coordinating wine or liquor bottles. Wine bottle labels will easily give your 20’s gift a personal touch! MADE IN THE USA: Roaring 20's - 1920s Art Deco Jazz Wine Bottle Label Stickers are designed and manufactured at our Wisconsin facility using materials that are Made in the USA. Please Note: Wine in image is not included. Roaring 20's Wine Bottle Labels No-Mess Glitter Print: Our beverage labels are designed with a printed image of glitter, eliminating glitter flake while maximizing bling effect!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713pz+lVscL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B075ZZDZXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075ZZDZXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075ZZDZXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
