window.products.push({"id":580775,"name":"Jeinny Personalized Ferris Wheel Snowman Family Name Lamp| Custom 1-12 Name Snowman Lamp for Home Holiday Party Decor with Snowmen Pendent (23.5*21*9.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XlpeSMeYL._AC_.jpg","description":"♥ Perfect Ferris Wheel Decor ❉ Our desk ferris wheel snowmen decoration lamp is suitable for decorating home, office,restaurant, coffee shop and various locations for creating Christmas spirit, a perfect festival decor for Christmas party, family gatherings, office celebration, mall counters and so on. You can display it in your kitchen, living room, dining room, porch, patio and any other indoor or outdoor locations for unique festive atmosphere and scene. ♥ Ferris Wheel Snowman Lamp ❉ The ferris wheel metal ornament display stand exceptional stability from the sturdy iron base lets you share cherished ferris wheel snowman ornaments with confidence. You can hang other festival ornaments that you want to DIY your lamp. ♥ Applicable Ocasions ❉ these custom lamp are suitable for various occasions, such as Christmas party, Valentine's day, Halloween, New Year, birthday party, wedding, ceremony, anniversary and more ♥ How To Personalize ❉ Choose the style you want → Click \"Customize Now\" or \"View All Purchase Options\" button → Upload 1-12 names → Add to cart and finish. Then you will get a romantic ferris wheel snowmen lamp decoration .USB lamp cable + two battery lamp cables: the battery lamp cable requires three button batteries and two 5 # batteries (Note: batteries are not included) ♥ After-sales service ❉ We appreciate your trust and want to make sure everything works for you. Due to overseas shipping, in order to try to ensure the integrity of the item, the default sent Ferris wheel, light wire and snowman need to assemble themselves.If there is damage, please contact our customer service for a return or refund in 30 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XlpeSMeYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jeinny","source_asin":"B0BJZZ6K5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJZZ6K5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJZZ6K5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":580776,"name":"Dragon's Blood Sedum - Stonecrop - Loves the Sun - Live Plant - Quart Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HxiAVax5S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"An excellent rock-hardy plant! Flowering late spring and summer. They enjoy full sun, but some shade is OK. A reliable, hardy and easy to grow perennial, Sedums provide color and interest to your garden from spring to the first snow of winter.Dragon's Blood Sedum (Sedum spurium 'Dragon's Blood') One of the easiest ground covers to grow. Easy to maintain and needs little water. Does great in poor soil. Bronze-green foliage produces intense red flowers. Bloom June through August. Plant in full sun, 12 inches apart. Grows only 3 to 6 inches tall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HxiAVax5S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hirt's Gardens","source_asin":"B013RHF1G0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013RHF1G0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013RHF1G0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
