window.products.push({"id":580780,"name":"WILLSLAND Automatic Soap Dispenser, Touchless Foam Soap Dispenser 500ml with 2 Modes of Foam Volume, Hands Free Infrared Motion Sensor for Foaming Soa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z9V8Pbx9L._AC_SL1267_.jpg","description":"TOUCHLESS FOR LESS BACTERIA: While touch-on soap dispensers may have cross-infection problem, our touchless foam soap dispenser makes it totally hands free, stopping bacteria and viruses from spreading. With the infrared motion sensor, reach your hand into the sensing area and the nozzle will dispense foam right onto your hand automatically. 2 MODES OF FOAM VOLUME FOR ADULT AND CHILDREN: You can adjust the amount of foam dispensed each time by single press on the switch on the top. The mode you have chosen is shown on the LCD screen. It fits adult and children with different hand sizes. LOW POWER CONSUMPTION: Powered by 4*AA batteries (excluded) which can last 3-5 months for 5,000 times use in a common family. No using, no power consumption. LCD screen displays the remaining power helping you get the replacement batteries ready. Battery loader on the back makes it much easier to replace batteries with no risk of getting in a mess with the hand sanitizer. EASY REFILLING AND SAVE HAND SANITIZER: Foaming hand sanitizer can be filled into the 500ML container and directly used. Ordinary Non-foaming hand sanitizer needs to be diluted with water before using, and the dilution ratio is 1:3(sanitizer: water). Shake the container to mix them better. 6-MONTH WARRANTY: Backed by WILLSLAND’s 6-month free return service. The package comes with an automatic foaming soap dispenser, an instruction manual and wall-mounted accessories. Feel free to contact us to obtain the warranty service if you have any issue with our touchless foam soap dispenser.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z9V8Pbx9L._AC_SL1267_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WILLSLAND","source_asin":"B088SBJLP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088SBJLP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088SBJLP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
