window.products.push({"id":580796,"name":"Disposable Paper Liner For Air Fryer,Non-stick Air Fryer Parchment Paper Liners,Oil-proof And Waterproof Liners for Air Fryer basket,Compatible With A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LWbOP7mRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP CLEAN AND SAVE TIME: This disposable air fryer paper liner absorbs oil and moisture from the food well, making the air fryer as clean as before it was used, reducing your work in the kitchen and saving valuable time HEALTHY AND RELIABLE KITCHEN AID: This food-grade air fryer paper can withstand temperatures up to 220°C (to prevent the paper liner from burning, do not heat the air fryer with little or no food!) Non-stick food , which can ensure that the food is the original taste you want, so that the family can enjoy healthier and more delicious food MULTIPLE USES: Parchment paper for air fryer, parchment paper for baking, suitable for chicken wings and drumsticks, chips, fish, meat, steak, chicken fillets, pizza and sausages, etc. It can also be used in microwave ovens, ovens, steamers, etc. QUANTITY OPTIONAL: 50/100pcs air fryer parchmment paper liners, the top diameter is 7.9inch, the bottom diameter is 6.3inch, the edge is 1.8inch high, and the air fryer with a capacity of 2.5-4 quart is enough for daily use. No Interfering with Internal Air Circulation: The heat is produced by air circulation through the pan wall. These air disposable papers do not affect this air circulation USE TIPS: When the air fryer is preheating, do not put only the disposable paper liner. When using, press the paper plate with food, the food should not be too small, so as not to be too light, and put as much food as possible (the purpose is to prevent the fryer paper from being adsorbed on the heat pipe of the fryer, causing the paper plate to burn","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LWbOP7mRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YTTERBIU","source_asin":"B09TYS41XT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TYS41XT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TYS41XT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
