window.products.push({"id":580878,"name":"Magic Line Square Cake Pan - Aluminum Pans for Brownies, Cakes, & Casserole Dishes (10x10x3 Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yZtBXAZMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you planning to make layered cakes but worried about uneven sides & surfaces? Good thing here’s Parrish Magic Line Round Cake Pan for home & professional baking! The circle cake pan features soft walls without ridges, allowing you to make mouthwatering cakes like a pro! Simply spray baking oil, pour the mixture onto the pan, bake according to the recipe, & wait for the evenly baked cake. It’s also an easy-to-clean bake pan! Just use a small brush and hand wash the cake baking pans using metal-safe dishwashing liquid for best results. There’s no need to worry about chipped metal after every use! Most importantly, Magic Line’s aluminum cake pans are made only from safe & non-toxic materials to ensure you & your family’s safety. Avoid contamination & allergic reactions when you use these cake tins for baking. Each pan measures 8 inches in diameter with a depth of 2 inches. The heavy gauge aluminum ensures uniform heat distribution for making delicious cakes & casserole dishes. Parrish Magic Line Round Cake Pan: For a hassle-free baking experience","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yZtBXAZMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Parrish Magic Line","source_asin":"B001HL02FE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001HL02FE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001HL02FE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
