window.products.push({"id":580917,"name":"TAOCOCO Stretch Sofa Covers 4 Pieces Soft Slipcovers with 3 Seat Cushion Couch Cover Replacement Coat for Settee Ektorp Sofa Furniture Protector Spand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cXcHpwuAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Quality Material. The TAOCOCO cushion sofa covers are made from 88% polyester & 12% spandex blend jacquard fabric, super soft and comfortable to touch, stretchy thick fabric sofa slipcovers are durable enough for many years use. Measure Size. Small size is suitable for 1 seat sofa length between 32\"-47\", Medium size for 2 seat sofa length between 57\"-70\", Large size for 3 seat sofa length between 72\"-92\". Each chair cushion covers measure up to 20-25 inch length, 20-27.5 inch wide, 2-9 inch thickness. Our sofa cover is exclusive designed for those sofas with separate cushions. Please refer to the measurement guide in photo for more details, please measure your cushion couch before place the order. Functional. Our cushion covers for individual cushions could protect your furniture from daily tear, spills, stains and so on, give some broken sofa a new rejuvenated look, great choice for homes with children and pets. Come with many colors and sizes, convenient to update the look of your armchair, loveseat, settee ektorp sofa, match the style of your living room, will absolutely saves you hundreds of dollars for each chair or sofa in upholstering costs. Perfect Fit. Thank to the high elasticity fabric, TAOCOCO cushion protector covers with elastic band sewn in the hem, flexible enough to warp your cushion in whole tightly without sliding or shifting. Allow for easy installation and secure in place, more convenient for you to wash the sofa slipcovers regularly. Easy Care. TAOCOCO sofa covers are machine washable, for good and easy maintenance better wash at cold water or below 30 degrees Celsius. Please do not bleach and iron. Using mild laundry detergents and tumble dry low or lime up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cXcHpwuAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAOCOCO","source_asin":"B08XZ11GXN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XZ11GXN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XZ11GXN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
