window.products.push({"id":580966,"name":"Joyful Space Company Drawer Organizers Optimized for use in Dresser Drawers or Closet Shelves - Perfect for Storing Your Clothing, Underwear, Socks, a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51e8Bjql4PL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Joyful Space Company's (TM) drawer and closer organizers are the high-quality solution for your home organization needs. Perfect for t-shirts, socks, underwear, pants, nursery items, keys, wallet, phone, cosmetics, lotions, essential oils. These cloth storage boxes are perfectly sized to work well in a variety of spaces, including shallow or narrow dresser drawers, closet shelves, or wherever you need to keep things tidy. The neutral color matches any decor. Solves Clutter Instantly! Easy to use solution ends clutter in your dresser, closets, and shelves. Select the box that best meets your needs-- quickly unfold it and it's ready to go. Modular Design / Mix and Match The set of 6 boxes in 3 sizes allow you to mix and match as you need. 2 smalls are the same size as 1 medium, 2 mediums are the same size as 1 large. Optimized 3\" height allows you to more easily see the items in each box. High Quality Cloth Construction 100% polypropylene breathable non-woven fabric. Sturdy cloth covered cardboard bottom provides additional stability. Foldable, Light-weight and Odor FreeBoxes store flat, are sturdy but lightweight and emit absolutely no odor upon arrival. Fresh and ready to go! 1 Year Warranty100% Satisfaction Guarantee. Joyful Space Company's products are backed by our manufacturer 30 day money back guarantee with 1 year free replacement warranty. Specifications- Material: 100% polypropylene breathable non-woven fabric. Box sizes: 2 large (11\"x11\"x 3\"), 2 medium (5.5\"x 11\" x 3\"), 2 small (5.5\" x 5.5\" X 3\") Contents- 2 large boxes with bottom inserts- 2 medium boxes with bottom inserts- 2 small boxes with bottom inserts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51e8Bjql4PL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joyful Space Company","source_asin":"B07QW4FZGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QW4FZGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QW4FZGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":580967,"name":"Lawyer Gifts – (2 Sided) Funny Unique Novelty Stemless Wine Glass Birthday or Christmas Gifts For Paralegal, Attorney, Legal Assistant, or Law Student","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yQO8iTreS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"So you’ve searched Amazon far and wide for the ultimate unique funny lawyer, paralegal, or legal assistant gifts available. Perhaps you’ve stumbled across gift ideas that you feel your friend or relative would never use? We’re glad you’ve found this gem of a hilariously funny and one of a kind gift for any lawyer, attorney, or law school student who enjoys the occasional glass of their favorite vino or prosecco. Let’s face it, every kitchen in America has wine glasses in them, most sit on the shelf, blank and boring. Why not spruce the cabinets up and buy a wine glass with some laughter on it.Nothing is more humorous than a personalized stemless wine glass with a cute saying on the side to help your gift recipient unwind after a long day’s work. This wine glass shows the scales of justice on one side and states “ Good Day, Bad Day, and Don’t Ask ” on the other side. It’s a simple yet amusing saying that will be sure to put a smile on legal professional’s face from ear to ear. Ready to make your friends laugh? Order today! Simply click the “Add to Cart” button and Amazon will promptly ship the item to your door. Don’t forget to pick up a wine glass for yourself as well! We wouldn’t want you missing out on wine night!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yQO8iTreS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funny Bone Products","source_asin":"B07H817S8B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-580967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H817S8B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H817S8B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
